{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50275","headline":"九日同诸公殊俗之作 · 马云奇","name":"九日同诸公殊俗之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一人歌唱数人啼，拭泪相看意转迷。\n不见书传清（青）海北，只知魂断陇山西。\n登高乍似云霄近，寓目仍惊草树低。\n菊酒何须频劝酌，自然心醉已如泥。\n（太常妻曰一日不斋醉如泥）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马云奇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}